  <History Date="26-01-23" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created from Chauvet Ovation CYC 1 FC (note separate DMX charts document is missing the 16 channel mode and the 1 and 3Ch mode show the same 3 channels.  Used manual version)" Version="3" />
